# CYD Visual Polish: Anti-Aliasing + Gauge Normalization [IMPL:CYD-AA]

> Three targeted changes to the CYD Phase 1b firmware to achieve visual parity with the desktop Skia renderer: (1) coverage-based anti-aliasing on geometric primitives, (2) gauge text offset normalization with desktop, (3) font atlas size coverage for gauge subtitle text.

**All three are now BUILT.** This document was written as a work order and has been
brought current to the code it describes; read it as a record of a completed change, not
as instructions to execute.

