| `src/font_atlas.h` | Regenerated if sizes added — DONE |

### 4.2 Validation

Compile with `pio run` from the project root (`${COMPOSEIO_HOME}/cyd/`). The build must succeed with zero errors. The dashboard demo (`main.cpp`) is unchanged — visual validation is done by the human comparing CYD display output with the desktop crosscheck PNG.

